    \u0447\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0437 {0}..."
  - I cacciatori arrivano tra {0}...
  - "\u0141owcy wyrusz\u0105 za {0}..."
  - Pemburu datang dalam {0}...
  - De jagers komen over {0}...
